  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme funded temporary deployment for a Humanitarian Second Secretary role at the British Consulate General-Jerusalem.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme-funded temporary deployment for the role of Humanitarian Second Secretary role-Home Country Staff (HCF)- will be responsible for humanitarian reporting and providing information analysis, updates on key figures, incidents, events, and humanitarian trends in relation to the situation in the Occupied Palestinian Territories. This role will help boost the British Consulate General-Jerusalem BCGJ&apos;s humanitarian reporting capacity which will feed into policy and advice.</narrative>
  </description>
